Matchbook includes and derives from third-party open data. Attribution follows.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
BPI Challenge 2019
  van Dongen, Boudewijn (2019): BPI Challenge 2019. Version 1.
  4TU.ResearchData. dataset. https://doi.org/10.4121/uuid:d06aff4b-79f0-45e6-8ec8-e19730c248f1
  License: Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0)
           https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
  Used in: logs/snapshot/ (a sampled subset, unmodified field values), and as the
  source distribution fitted by seed/fit.py. Changes made: sampling, conversion
  from IEEE XES to the Matchbook canonical CSV/SQLite schema, export to OTLP/JSON
  spans (one trace per case, one zero-duration span per event), conversion to
  DataFrame-ready CSV tables with a dtypes sidecar (logs/frames/), and documented
  deterministic tie-breaking of equal timestamps.
  The organizers' own CSV conversion is fetched as a cross-check only, never
  committed, and is attributed to the same author and DOI.

